      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SPIDER INTENTION (6) chased the lead early from the inside and boxed on well to finish third, beaten 11 lengths (26.40) at this track in a Maiden over 460m. Can measure up this time. PAW NINA (7) shows ability but remains a maiden after eight starts. Was below best last time when missed the frame finishing third (22.68) at Ballarat. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings two times from three attempts. Well placed and gets her chance. CHEER CHEER (4) jumped well and was in the mix early before fading out of it late when 6th over 435m at Sale in Maiden company. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings two times from three starts. Worth following up. ADA'S HAND (3) hit the frame here last start so don't underestimate.",
